r lab, Kaban, who has been researching with the owls, explains that the tiger they encountered was a Beast, an animal who didn't become a Friend upon encountering Sandstar.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AbOY7Ok97Ph5r8tO9t2Cjlg12Kh.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"After taking Kyururu and the others back to her lab, Kaban, who has been researching with the owls, explains that the tiger they encountered was a Beast, an animal who didn't become a Friend upon encountering Sandstar.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AbOY7Ok97Ph5r8tO9t2Cjlg12Kh.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13055","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"99624","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35313","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69288","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319997","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"88441","synopsis":"In the desert, Kyururu's group comes across a cheetah who is challenged to a race by a pronghorn, with Serval deciding to participate.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oqhJPX9B5lCmQX38ISGrHMmvZSz.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"In the desert, Kyururu's group comes across a cheetah who is challenged to a race by a pronghorn, with Serval deciding to participate.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oqhJPX9B5lCmQX38ISGrHMmvZSz.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"13055","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"99624","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"35313","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"6